{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはみさ（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、こんにちみさみさ（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5,6日と ミニ握手会で\n香川県・愛知県に行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴールデンウイークの中\nたくさんの方が駆けつけてくださって\n本当に嬉しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も、たくさんの\n「頑張ってね」「応援してるよ」\nみなさんの暖かい応援メッセージを\nもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴールデンウイークということで\n家族で来られている方もいっぱい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い物に来てて 通りかかったよ\n近くだから気になって来てみたよ\nって 初めて握手する方や\n興味を持ってくださった方も結構いて\n乃木坂46を より多くの人に\n知ってもらえたんじゃないかなっと\n思います(=´∀｀)人(´∀｀=)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他の県に行ってきたメンバー達も、\n一緒のグループだった\nみゅうみゅう・まりか・ねねも\n2日間 おつかれさま～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルでは 一緒だったのはみゅみゅ♪\n伊藤ちゃんずのお部屋にも\n遊びに行ったよ～（＾Ｏ＾）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。\n足を運んでくださったみなさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、楽しい2日間を\n本当にありがとうございました(*^^*)\nCDいっぱい聴いて欲しいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12日の東京個別ももうすぐやな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうそう。ついこの間\nみゅうみゅうと川後のひなから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「個別で一緒にコスプレしない」\n(=´∀｀)人(´∀｀=)？？？\nって誘われました。わお。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".....ぇ((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))ええぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、思いましたがきっと\nこれ見たみなさんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えぇええぇ((((；ﾟДﾟ)))))))！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じですよね（笑）\nちなみに、セーラー服。\n最後に着たのはいつだろう。\n5年も前か....orz"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー19でセーラー服はきついって！\n無理あるって！だって美彩で？？\n(ちょ、ちょっと着てみたい)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と みゅうみゅうに言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからコスプレって言うんだよ？\nと一言。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たしかに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもな、でもな\n個別の服もう決めてるんよな....."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで。\nみゅうみゅうと川後のひなと\nお買い物に行ってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/07/6841759/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買うかはまだ分かりません。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまたねっ☆\nmisa."}],"source":"archive"}